  "qid": "296",
  "tip": "<p>Distinguish between IAM roles that manage Cloud SQL resources and database level privileges that control data access. If the question stresses instance lifecycle and configuration without data access, look for an admin role and ensure no role that grants <i>connect</i> or database login is required.</p>",
